  "howToPlayBody": "Move all the cards to the four nests, from Ace to King, by suit.\n\nIn the columns, a card goes on one rank higher, of the other colour, and sequences move together. Only a King can go to an empty column.\n\nClick the deck to draw a card. When it runs out, click again to turn the waste over.\n\nPoints: 5 from the waste to a column, 10 to a nest, 5 for each card turned face up, minus 15 for taking a card from a nest and minus 100 for turning the waste over.\n\nCtrl+Z undoes, Ctrl+R restarts this game and Ctrl+N starts a new one.",
